  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mo>|</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mrow><mo>|</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mrow><mo>|</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;(as the three vectors are mutually perpendicular)</p><p>So,&nbsp;<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>&#215;</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8722;</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo>.</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mrow></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo>.</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>(</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>.</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>.</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8722;</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>.</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>]</mo></mrow></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>(</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>.</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>]</mo></mrow></math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo> <mn>2</mn> <mo>&#183;</mo> <mn>1</mn> <mo>&#183;</mo> <mn>2</mn> <mo>&#183;</mo> <mn>3</mn> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo> <mn>1</mn> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </math></p>"
